255
00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:54.390
Nii õnnelikud.

256
00:16:57.720 --> 00:16:59.600
Mina ei tea, ma ütlen ausalt,
Laura, meil on

257
00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:03.320
