291
00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:26.340
See on mingi õel pleipois
tordimeister. No miks te, mina?

292
00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.790
Kriisi on see ka.

293
00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:38.830
Panen üles selle.

294
00:19:38.930 --> 00:19:40.509
On üleval ja?

295
00:19:40.609 --> 00:19:43.210
10 minutit lahutust, teistmoodi

296
00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.040
