326
00:21:52.650 --> 00:21:55.769
Aga kui ei tule?

327
00:21:55.869 --> 00:21:58.194
Issand, juma.

328
00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:08.300
Bingo.

329
00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:12.550
Aksel kuuled,

330
00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:15.325
