Ma ei tea.

345
00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:25.590
Kurat.

346
00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:32.120
Ka ühe praadi.

347
00:23:32.220 --> 00:23:36.090
Stop stoppopp mida? Stop stopp.

348
00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:39.540
Hakkas kiire kuhugi.

349
00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:42.115
Kuidas palun, nimi?

350
00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:47.540
Nüüd peangi ütlema praegu nimi,
