351
00:23:47.640 --> 00:23:49.220
Ants.

352
00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:52.910
Laura nimi tuleb tuttavat.

353
00:23:53.010 --> 00:23:55.759
Laura, mis mis, mis küsimus,
