359
00:24:19.520 --> 00:24:21.330
Mis toimub praegu?

360
00:24:21.430 --> 00:24:23.250
Ma tahan ka teada, mis toimub.

361
00:24:23.350 --> 00:24:24.780
Pead lolliks minna,

362
00:24:24.880 --> 00:24:26.310
pead lolliks.

363
00:24:26.410 --> 00:24:30.269
Kõigepealt tahad Laura pagarire
endale taskusse panna,

364
00:24:30.369 --> 00:24:34.160
