368
00:24:45.760 --> 00:24:49.270
Hakkame tal tun, aitab, aitab juba.
Mis sa teed?

369
00:24:52.690 --> 00:24:54.790
Oot.

370
00:24:59.210 --> 00:25:01.090
Aksel.

371
00:25:01.190 --> 00:25:02.830
Vabandust, et.

372
00:25:02.930 --> 00:25:08.470
Ants, mis toimub, on sul kõik hästi
või?

373
00:25:08.570 --> 00:25:09.460
Noh

374
00:25:09.560 --> 00:25:12.750
midagi positiivset aksli kohta

375
00:25:12.850 --> 00:25:14.790
Noh.

376
00:25:14.890 --> 00:25:18.000
Aksel on.

377
00:25:18.100 --> 00:25:21.269
Ta on vahel tormakas.

378
00:25:21.369 --> 00:25:23.869
Aga süda on tal hea.

379
00:25:25.780 --> 00:25:29.269
Ta ei teeks kärbselle kili.

380
00:25:29.369 --> 00:25:32.519
Sest esiteks on ta selleks juba
liiga mugav.

381
00:25:35.240 --> 00:25:38.360
Aitäh sulle. Ta.

382
00:25:38.460 --> 00:25:39.980
Ma ei ole mõrvar ainult
sellepärast,

383
00:25:40.080 --> 00:25:43.030
