384
00:25:43.130 --> 00:25:46.060
Tänan sind. Ints.

385
00:25:46.160 --> 00:25:48.400
Ints.

386
00:25:48.500 --> 00:25:52.640
Mine minema. Mida sa teed,
sa tuled antsu ähvardama,

387
00:25:53.420 --> 00:25:56.890
