399
00:26:33.310 --> 00:26:35.635
Aitab viitab.

400
00:26:56.180 --> 00:26:57.580
Vabandust.

401
00:26:57.680 --> 00:27:01.870
Asi asi ei ole sinus,
see on minu asi jälle.

402
00:27:01.970 --> 00:27:04.220
Na andeks?

403
00:27:05.810 --> 00:27:07.870
Ütle mulle,
kas ma olen halb inimene.

404
00:27:07.970 --> 00:27:10.270
Ütle ausalt.

405
00:27:13.180 --> 00:27:14.910
Ma ei tea,
ma ei tunne ennast hästi,

406
00:27:15.010 --> 00:27:16.710
