407
00:27:16.810 --> 00:27:20.400
Oleks mingi karistuse vist ära
teeninud.

408
00:27:20.500 --> 00:27:23.500
Äkki teeme kolmapäeval jälle
pikemalt?

409
00:27:31.440 --> 00:27:33.940
See on, see on minu.

410
00:27:38.160 --> 00:27:40.210
A.

411
00:27:40.740 --> 00:27:42.890
Aitäh.

412
00:28:02.240 --> 00:28:04.540
Mona.

413
00:28:04.640 --> 00:28:10.670
Sa ei kujuta ette ka videole,
on üle 20000 vaatamise. Tere.

414
00:28:10.770 --> 00:28:13.070
Tere, Laura.

415
00:28:17.430 --> 00:28:19.759
Siis.

416
00:28:19.859 --> 00:28:23.084
Siis läheb asjaks, tundub nii, jah,
tundub nii.

417
00:28:29.080 --> 00:28:31.350
Nii hoopis.

418
00:28:31.450 --> 00:28:35.960
Meie müstiline mistrix.

419
00:28:36.060 --> 00:28:39.260
Kiimas paar oli ainult mingi
